<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets one-yr bond auction Sept 26.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets one-yr bond auction Sept 26.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Finance Ministry will auction an unspecified tranche of one-year bonds on September 26, the central bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the bonds, which will carry an 8.5 percent coupon, will have a minimum price of par. In the last auction of similar bonds on August 20, the coupon was set at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank added that interest on the bonds will be paid semi-annually. The bonds will hold a nominal value of 100,000 crowns.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
